query: -->\n    <!-- <script src=\"//ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jquery/1.10.2/jquery.min.js\"></script> -->\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"http://example.com/js/jquery-ui-1.10.3.custom.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"http://example.com/styles/flick/jquery-ui-1.10.3.custom.min.css\"/>\n</head>\n```\n\nThe html comment gets uncommented. And the following line is omitted.\n\n``` html\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"http://example.com/js/jquery-ui-1.10.3.custom.min.js\"></script>\n```\n\nThe result is:\n\n``` html\n<head><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"http://example.com/js/jquery-1.10.2.min.js\"></script><script src=\"//ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jquery/1.10.2/jquery.min.js\"></script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"http://example.com/styles/flick/jquery-ui-1.10.3.custom.min.css\"/></head>\n```\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcit-ci/CodeIgniter/issues/2772/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcit-ci/CodeIgniter/issues/2772/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":207672852,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDIwNzY3Mjg1Mg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcit-ci/CodeIgniter/issues/events/207672852","actor":{"login":"narfbg","id":1058011,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTgwMTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1058011?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/narfbg","html_url":"https://github.com/narfbg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narfbg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narfbg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narfbg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narfbg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narfbg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https